      this might afford different sorts of motion in one system. With acceleration
      will this be on a destination basis or raw kinematics?
    sound system ( you can already *play* sound, but you need something to manage 

  - FEATURES:
    ---------
    Support timer IDs pointing to which BG tile to animate next 
    tile-based animations w/ timers
    parallax (ditto)
    auto-looping bg
    camera following entity, should be easy to switch
    inherit menu to entity menu (later w/ grid)
    notify uncollisions as well
    lerping
    place mobile entities at the front of collision system
    Z-ordering-- use q-sorting, or some kind of built-in sorter
    bump allocator
    in-memory resources
    *my* map
    graph-based scene traversal; seems clearer now that each scene appears to be an entity in itself
    bar
    dice
    resource-loading

  - DESIGN:
    -------
    Split views up into M, V, and/or C components. Scene, for instance, should be flexible enough to keep its controller aspects across display types.
